  lines:
  - speaker: Detective
    text: Mr Voss, there seems to be evidence tying you to Mr Reyes's murder. I'm
      gonna need you to come with me
  - speaker: Henry
    text: there must be some misunderstanding.
  - speaker: Detective
    text: 'Sir, there are officers on route to this location. '
  - speaker: Detetctive
    text: I'd advise you to come quietly.
  - speaker: Henry
    text: This isn't right...
  - speaker: 'Detective '
    text: Mr Voss, I'm placing you under arrest for conspiring to murder Mr Reyes
  - speaker: Henry
    text: Oh god, I can't go down like this.
